      leading_comments: " dev_shm_size_bytes is the tmpfs size to use when creating a\n TYPE_DEVSHM resource for id for the first time. Ignored for every\n other type, and ignored if a TYPE_DEVSHM resource for id already\n exists (the size used by whichever caller created it first wins;\n callers within one sandbox are expected to agree on it, since\n containerd sends every member container of a pod the same /dev/shm\n size). A value that is zero or absent falls back to a guest-side\n default.\n"
